{"id":"00146","root":"uni00146_1","name":{"ja":"リリス","en":"Lilith the First"},"title":{"ja":"【魔女だってクリスマス】","en":"【Witchy Christmas】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【魔女だってクリスマス】 リリス","en":"【Witchy Christmas】 Lilith the First"},"element":"Devilish","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":["Magic"],"release":"2018-12-14","limited":true,"characterId":20,"profile":{"ja":"通称“黒蛇の魔女”。神に反逆し神々を異界に追いやったとされる伝説の大魔女リリスの孫娘。高位魔族の少女でその寿命は数万年に及ぶという。魔界の住人なら誰もが知り恐れ、３００キロは避けて通ると謳われた祖母の名を継いで二代目リリスとなり、武者修行のために人界に降り立つ。才能は魔界随一だがいまだ未熟者。１人ではオークの群れにも逃げ惑うレベルだが秘めたる野望は誰にも負けない天然系。男なら誰しも気になる巨乳の美少女。先代から仕える使い魔（＝従者）、メスの白い犬ベリリクが彼女を護衛し普段の生活をサポートしている。リリスはちょっと長生きで人に化けれるただの白い犬と信じて疑っていないが、ベリリクの正体は神殺しで知られる古代龍（エンシェント・ドラゴン）である。初めてのクリスマスを楽しむためにサンタ衣装に着替え、都会の聖夜を楽しもうとしている。","en":"Lilith the First, she/her: Known as the \"Black Serpent Witch.\" She is the legendary Grand Witch Lilith's granddaughter, who rebelled against the gods and banished them to another realm. As a high-ranking demon-folk girl, her lifespan stretches for tens of thousands of years. Every resident of the Demon Realm knows and fears her, and it is said that they keep a 300-kilometre distance. Inheriting her grandmother's name, she becomes the second-generation Lilith and descends to the Human Realm for warrior training. Her talent is unrivaled in the Demon Realm, yet she remains inexperienced. On her own she would flee from a pack of orcs, but her hidden ambition rivals no one's—she's a natural-born dreamer. Any man can't help but be drawn to her curvaceous beauty. Serving her is a familiar spirit—a white female dog named Berylic—who guards her and assists with daily life. Lilith believes, without doubt, that Berylic is merely a long-lived white dog that can shape-shift, but in truth Berylic is an ancient dragon famed for slaying gods. To enjoy her first Christmas, she's changed into a Santa outfit and is ready to revel in the city's holy night."},"illustrator":"旭","voiceActor":"中家志穂","forms":[{"id":"uni00146_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","l