se","index":3,"text":{"ja":"あん！　これはダメですよー。いい子にあげるプレゼントが入ってるんですからー。悪い子にはあげません。めっ！","en":"Ah! That's not allowed. It contains presents for good kids, you see—won't give them to naughty ones. Got it!"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00146_1/uni00146_1_hom_3.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":4,"text":{"ja":"クリスマスっていいですよねー。どんな子でも等しく幸せが訪れるんですよ？　それって素敵なコトじゃないですか","en":"Christmas is wonderful, isn't it? No matter who you are, happiness comes to everyone, right? Isn't that a lovely thing?"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00146_1/uni00146_1_hom_4.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":5,"text":{"ja":"はい。いまからプレゼントを配りますよー。手伝ってくれるいい子は居ませんかねー？　チラチラっ","en":"Alright. I'm going to start handing out presents now. Anyone willing to help, any good kids out there? *wink*"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00146_1/uni00146_1_hom_5.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":6,"text":{"ja":"メリークリスマス♪　サンタクロースのリリスでぇす","en":"Merry Christmas♪ It's Lilith the Santa"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00146_1/uni00146_1_hom_6.ogg"},{"type":"hom","label":"Home","variant":"base","index":7,"text":{"ja":"実は私、サンタ見習いでして。おヒゲはありませんが、サンタ特製クリスマスケーキなら、たっくさんありますよぉー♪","en":"Actually, I'm a Santa apprentice. I don't have a beard, but I've got plenty of Santa-special Christmas cake, you know~♪"},"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00146_1/uni00146_1_hom_7.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00146_1/uni00146_1_atk_1.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00146_1/uni00146_1_atk_2.ogg"},{"type":"atk","label":"Attack","variant":"base","index":3,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00146_1/uni00146_1_atk_3.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":1,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00146_1/uni00146_1_dmg_1.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Damaged","variant":"base","index":2,"text":null,"clip":"Audio/Voice/uni00146_1/uni00146_1_dmg_2.ogg"},{"type":"dmg","label":"Da